docs {
  # Search Usulan Pengabdian
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/usulan-pengabdian/search`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request Body)
  
  ```typescript
  interface SearchPengabdianDTO {
    keyword?: string;
    status?: string;
    tahun_akademik_id?: string;
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | keyword | string | ❌ | Cari di judul/abstrak |
  | status | string | ❌ | Filter status usulan |
  | tahun_akademik_id | UUID | ❌ | Filter tahun akademik |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mencari usulan pengabdian",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "judul": "Program Pelatihan",
        "status": "Disetujui",
        "ketua": { "name": "Dr. Ahmad" },
        "tahunAkademik": { "tahun": "2024/2025" }
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "total": 3
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
}
